@shizuku/pmd contains code under two licenses.

The TypeScript in src/, scripts/ and test/, and native/pmd_wasm.c,
native/drums.c and native/build.sh are part of shizuku-web and under its MIT
license (../../LICENSE).

The PMD driver and the YM2608 (OPNA) emulator in native/98fmplayer/, and
therefore the WebAssembly built from them (wasm/pmd.wasm, wasm/pmd.js), are
from 98fmplayer (https://github.com/myon98/98fmplayer, commit 4fa914e) under
the BSD 2-Clause License below. Anything that redistributes pmd.wasm (such as
the web app) must reproduce this notice.

